{"unit_id":"huhui-tech__dsh-host-notify#card-zh","repo":"huhui-tech/dsh-host-notify","commit":"52911560abc9d7feeb3f3a68399bce11c071db20","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-host-notify 是面向 DSH 桌面端的 macOS 宿主通知插件，可在模型提出问题、请求权限审批或方案确认，以及一轮回复完成时发出系统通知。它在宿主侧监听全局事件，通过随包提供的 DSH Notifier 应用投递通知，应用不可用时回退到 osascript；提问和审批会带上问题或操作摘要，回复完成会使用不同提示音。通知可附会话标题，并对重复事件去重。适合离开 DSH 页面时仍想留意待处理交互和后台回复的 macOS 用户；无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:47-68","index.js:123-198"]}
{"unit_id":"huhui-tech__dsh-host-notify#card-en","repo":"huhui-tech/dsh-host-notify","commit":"52911560abc9d7feeb3f3a68399bce11c071db20","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-host-notify alerts macOS DSH users when a question or approval needs attention or a reply finishes. It listens to host events and sends system notifications through its bundled app, falling back to osascript. Alerts can include a session label and suppress repeats. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:47-68","index.js:123-198"]}
